  },
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "sol.amc-10a-2003-p8.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The factors of \\(60\\) are \\(1,\\) \\(2,\\) \\(3,\\) \\(4,\\) \\(5,\\) \\(6,\\) \\(10,\\) \\(12,\\) \\(15,\\) \\(20,\\) \\(30,\\) and \\(60.\\)\n\nSix of these twelve factors are less than \\(7,\\) so the probability is \\(\\dfrac{6}{12} = \\dfrac{1}{2}.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is E.",
      "hints": [
        "List all positive divisors of \\(60\\)",
        "Count how many of the \\(12\\) divisors are less than \\(7\\)"
      ],
